{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","name_native":"সুনান আবু দাউদ","section":{"40":"Prescribed Punishments (Kitab Al-Hudud)"},"section_detail":{"40":{"hadithnumber_first":4351,"hadithnumber_last":4493,"arabicnumber_first":4351,"arabicnumber_last":4493,"name_native":"হদ (দণ্ডবিধি) অধ্যায়"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":4385,"arabicnumber":4385,"text":"। ইবনু উমার (রাঃ) সূত্রে বর্ণিত। রাসূলুল্লাহ সাল্লাল্লাহু আলাইহি ওয়াসাল্লাম তিন দিরহাম মূল্যের বর্ম চুরির দায়ে চোরের হাত কেটেছেন।[1] সহীহ।","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Sahih Bukhari (6795) Sahih Muslim (1686)"}],"reference":{"book":40,"hadith":35}}]}